 second, beating the British “Laurea” of " [:a {:href "/athletes/62380"} "Edward Hore"] " by just one point. The respective placements were 2-3-3 against 3-1-6 (DNF)."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In race three, Mr. " [:a {:href "/athletes/2305365"} "Rousselet"] ", who was aboard " [:a {:href "/athletes/63985"} "Jules Valton"] "’s yacht “Luna,” fell overboard in a rough sea. The description in the papers noted that the crew was fortunately able to get Rousselet back on board without the yacht having to turn around or stop."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Race 1 Points"] [:th {} "Race 2 Points"] [:th {} "Race 3 Points"] [:th {} "Race #1"] [:th {} "Race #2"] [:th {} "Race #3"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Estérel"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "29"] [:td {} "10"] [:td {} "9"] [:td {} "10"] [:td {} "4-17:12 (1)"] [:td {} "3-43:21 (2)"] [:td {} "3-22:36 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "15"} [:a {:href "/athletes/61357"} "Émile Billard"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/63278"} "Paul Perquer"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "Quand-Même"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "25"] [:td {} "9"] [:td {} "8"] [:td {} "8"] [:td {} "4-18:46 (2)"] [:td {} "3-46:11 (3)"] [:td {} "3-28:09 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "15"} [:a {:href "/athletes/61807"} "Jean, Duc Decazes"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} "Laurea"] [:t